        JetSet<em class="logo-boat">Boat</em>
      </a>
      <p class="footer-tagline">
        Beach &amp; Boat Parties<br>
        sur la Côte d'Azur
      </p>
      <a href="https://www.instagram.com/jetsetboat/" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="footer-social" aria-label="Instagram @jetsetboat">
